OL,3,ACanada's Prime Minister Carney to speak
OL,4,Aafter deadly fire at military base
OL,5,
OL,6,F"This kind of tragedy is unheard of", a
OL,7,Flocal mayor says, after several people
OL,8,Fwere killed in a large fire at a
OL,9,FCanadian military base in Alberta
OL,11,FThe fire is now contained, but rescue
OL,12,Fteams remain at the scene to prevent
OL,13,Fany potential flare-up, the mayor tells
OL,14,Fthe BBC
OL,16,FDetails are still unclear, but Canadian
OL,17,Fmedia report that at least seven were
OL,18,Fkilled and dozens more injured when a
OL,19,Fgas line or gas well was hit during a
OL,20,Flive-fire training exercise - here's
OL,21,Fwhat we know so far
OL,23,APub: 18-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,313,300,200,140,0,100
