OL,3,ACanada's Prime Minister Carney to speak
OL,4,Aafter deadly fire at military base
OL,5,
OL,6,FA defence spokesperson says that, while
OL,7,Finvestigations are under way, "at this
OL,8,Ftime, there are no indications that it
OL,9,Fwas the result of any terrorist
OL,10,Factivity"
OL,12,FCanadian Forces Base Wainwright, where
OL,13,Fthe fire broke out around 16:00 local
OL,14,Ftime (22:00 GMT) on Saturday, is one of
OL,15,Fthe country's busiest military training
OL,16,Fbases
OL,23,APub: 18-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
